.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH sharecli 1  "sharecli 0.8.0" 
.SH NAME
sharecli \- Shared CLI process manager for multi\-project agent orchestration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsharecli\fR [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-theme\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shared CLI process manager for multi\-project agent orchestration
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose output
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet mode
.TP
\fB\-\-theme\fR \fI<NAME>\fR [default: backbone\-2]
Color theme: `backbone\-2` / `bb2` / `dark` (default) or `backbone\-2\-light` / `light`. Maps to Backbone\-2 dark/light families in tokens.css
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
sharecli\-session(1)
Inspect durable agent sessions
.TP
sharecli\-surface(1)
Send shell\-free I/O requests to a ShareCLI\-enabled Ghostty surface
.TP
sharecli\-ps(1)
List managed processes
.TP
sharecli\-start(1)
Start a harness process
.TP
sharecli\-stop(1)
Stop managed processes
.TP
sharecli\-status(1)
Check process health
.TP
sharecli\-proc(1)
List host\-detected coding agents (proc scan + RSS/FD samples)
.TP
sharecli\-health(1)
Run a runtime health probe
.TP
sharecli\-config(1)
Configuration management
.TP
sharecli\-project(1)
Project management
.TP
sharecli\-optimize(1)
Optimize resource usage
.TP
sharecli\-prune(1)
Prune idle processes
.TP
sharecli\-pool(1)
Show shared runtime pool status
.TP
sharecli\-run(1)
Run using pooled runtime
.TP
sharecli\-limits(1)
Set project resource limits
.TP
sharecli\-check(1)
Check project resource limits
.TP
sharecli\-thermal(1)
Live thermal\-gate / hypervisor state monitor (TUI)
.TP
sharecli\-serve(1)
Start the HTTP + WebSocket dashboard server
.TP
sharecli\-report(1)
Print a fleet analytics snapshot (one\-shot or live watch mode)
.TP
sharecli\-fleet(1)
Fleet device management
.TP
sharecli\-mesh(1)
Maildir mesh task\-queue operator surface (status / reclaim)
.TP
sharecli\-fuse(1)
FUSE IO intercept operator surface (mount, provenance, CoW)
.TP
sharecli\-cast(1)
Cross\-machine text injection into registered terminal panes
.TP
sharecli\-proc\-compose(1)
process\-compose.yaml integration
.TP
sharecli\-completions(1)
Generate shell completion script
.TP
sharecli\-man(1)
Generate roff man page for sharecli(1) (clap_mangen)
.TP
sharecli\-list(1)
Enumerate available CLI surfaces (cast modules + utility modules)
.TP
sharecli\-soak(1)
Run the harbor soak harness \-\- long\-running CLI stability evaluation
.TP
sharecli\-upgrade(1)
Check for or apply an upstream release upgrade
.TP
sharecli\-version(1)
Print the sharecli version
.TP
sharecli\-uninstall(1)
Print uninstall guidance and optionally purge local config/state
.TP
sharecli\-undo(1)
Undo / restore model (C09 L81.9): inspect or replay the operations journal recorded at $XDG_STATE_HOME/sharecli/operations.jsonl
.TP
sharecli\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
Accessibility (C09): docs/a11y/README.md — NO_COLOR/TERM=dumb degrade ANSI color; FR\-004 status via `sharecli status` and GET /health. Degraded\-mode notes: docs/a11y/status\-and\-recovery.md
Help & FAQ (C09 L81.13): docs/faq.md — top troubleshooting answers; `man sharecli` after `just man`.
.SH VERSION
v0.8.0
